  "title": "CHANGE_TRUST fails with CHANGE_TRUST_INVALID_LIMIT",
  "pattern": "A transaction whose CHANGE_TRUST operation fails at apply is still written into the closed ledger: its fee is charged, its sequence number is consumed, and none of its operations change state. The result carries the operation's result code (invalid_limit). Readers that skip failed transactions lose the fee and sequence change; readers that assume a failed transaction changed something record effects that never happened.",
